        <span>${duelBtn}${boomBtn}${wwkBoomBtn}<button data-ubp-act="exit-game" style="background:none;border:none;font-size:16px;cursor:pointer;color:var(--ubp-text);" title="关闭本局（不保留进度）并返回板子页，下次进入即重新开局">✕</button></span>
