    addJudgeLog('🚨 警长竞选环节开始：想当警长的玩家请举手（上警），上警玩家将依次发表竞选发言，之后可以选择退水，未上警玩家投票选出警长（警长票计1.5票）。', true);
    saveGameRecord();
    renderGameUI();
    // 用户操作后置：先让全部 AI 思考是否上警，AI 全部表态完毕后再轮到用户选择
    askAiSheriffSignups();
  }
  function askAiSheriffSignups() {
    const session = game?.session;
    if (!isSessionValid(session) || game.sheriffStage !== 'signup') return;
    if (wolfBatchGuard.signup) return; // 该批AI请求已在途，防止重复发起
    const dec = game.sheriffSignDecided || (game.sheriffSignDecided = []);
    const eligible = game.players.filter(p => p.alive && !p.isUser);
    const pending = eligible.filter(p => dec.indexOf(p.position) === -1);
    if (!pending.length) { finishSheriffSignup(); return; }
    setControlArea('<div style="text-align:center;padding:6px;color:#fff;">还剩 ' + pending.length + ' 人正在思考是否上警：' + pending.map(p => p.name).join('、') + '...</div>');
    // 节约Token开启=沿用原分批方式；关闭=按RPM并发上限逐条请求
    wolfBatchGuard.signup = true;
    wolfRunBatch(session, pending, p => askOneSheriffSignup(session, p, dec), () => {
      wolfBatchGuard.signup = false;
      if (!isSessionValid(session) || game.sheriffStage !== 'signup') return;
      askAiSheriffSignups();
    });
  }
  function askOneSheriffSignup(session, p, dec) {
    return new Promise(finish => {
      let attempts = 0;
      const applyResult = (res) => {
        if (!isSessionValid(session) || game.sheriffStage !== 'signup') { finish(); return; }
        if (dec.indexOf(p.position) !== -1) { finish(); return; } // 防重复回调重复登记
        const parsedS = parseWolfSpeechResponse(res);
        addHiddenThought(parsedS.thought || '正在权衡是否上警竞选警长。', p.position);
        const m = String(res || '').match(/SHERIFF_RUN[^A-Za-z]{0,8}(YES|NO|是|否|上警|不上警)/i);
        const yesRun = !!(m && /^(YES|是|上警)$/i.test(m[1]));
        if (dec.indexOf(p.position) === -1) dec.push(p.position);
        if (yesRun && game.sheriffCandidates.indexOf(p.position) === -1) game.sheriffCandidates.push(p.position);
        addGameLog('✅ ' + p.name + '（' + p.position + '号位）已完成思考');
        saveGameRecord();
        renderGameUI();
        finish();
      };
      const applyDefault = () => {
        if (!isSessionValid(session) || game.sheriffStage !== 'signup') { finish(); return; }
        if (dec.indexOf(p.position) === -1) dec.push(p.position);
        addGameLog('✅ ' + p.name + '（' + p.position + '号位）已完成思考');
        saveGameRecord();
        renderGameUI();
        finish();
      };
      const attempt = () => {
        addGameLog('⏳ ' + p.name + '（' + p.position + '号位）正在思考要不要上警...');
        const config = loadConfig();
        const overview = getGamePublicOverview(p);
        const history = getPlayerHistoryContext(p);
        const identityCtx = getPlayerIdentitySystemContext(p);
        const prompt = '现在是第1天白天的警长竞选环节（上警报名阶段）。' + overview + identityCtx + getInfoBoundaryRule() + '\n\n【场上历史公开发言与公告】：\n' + history + '\n\n【上警决策指引】：\n1. 警长拥有1.5票与决定发言顺序的权力，对阵营争夺非常关键。请结合你的底牌、角色人设与对局风格，认真权衡自己是否要上警竞选（例如预言家/强神职常考虑上警带节奏；狼人可考虑悍跳上警抢警徽；普通村民也可以上警挡刀或辅助；不想暴露身份可以不上警）。\n2. 【防全知铁律】只能依据自己的底牌与公开信息推理，严禁开天眼。\n3. 在<thinking>中输出完整的上警思考，在<SHERIFF_RUN>中明确写 YES（上警）或 NO（不上警）。\n\n输出格式必须为：\n<thinking>上警思考...</thinking>\n<SHERIFF_RUN>\nSHERIFF_RUN: [YES 或 NO]\n</SHERIFF_RUN>';
        apiChat([
          { role: 'system', content: '你是狼人杀玩家，正在决定是否上警竞选警长。必须代入角色人设与底牌立场进行思考，严格输出思考与报名格式，严禁开天眼。' },
          { role: 'user', content: prompt }
        ], config, { maxTokens: 3000 }).then(res => applyResult(res)).catch(err => {
          if (!isSessionValid(session) || game.sheriffStage !== 'signup') { finish(); return; }
          attempts += 1;
          handleAiFailure('AI上警思考（' + p.position + '号位 ' + p.name + '）', err, attempts, () => { attempt(); }, applyDefault);
        });
      };
      attempt();
    });
  }

  // 统一公布：上警报名结果（全部 AI 思考完毕、用户决定后一次性公布）
  function revealSheriffSignup() {
    if (!game || game.sheriffSignupRevealed) return;
    game.sheriffSignupRevealed = true;
    const decided = game.sheriffSignDecided || [];
    const cands = game.sheriffCandidates || [];
    game.players.forEach(p => {
      if (p.isUser) {
        if (!game.sheriffUserSignDecided) return;
      } else if (decided.indexOf(p.position) === -1) return;
      const who = p.isUser ? '你' : p.name;
      if (cands.indexOf(p.position) !== -1) addGameLog('🙋 ' + who + '（' + p.position + '号位）上警竞选警长！', true);
      else addGameLog('🙅 ' + who + '（' + p.position + '号位）选择不上警。', true);
    });
  }

  function finishSheriffSignup() {
    const session = game?.session;
    if (!isSessionValid(session) || game.sheriffStage !== 'signup') return;
    // 用户决策后置：AI 全部表态完毕后，才弹出用户的上警选择
    const userSign = game.players ? game.players[game.userIndex] : null;
    if (userSign && userSign.alive && !game.sheriffUserSignDecided) {
      addGameLog('🚨 全部AI玩家已完成上警思考，请选择你是否上警竞选警长：', false);
      saveGameRecord();
      renderGameUI();
      setControlArea('<div style="display:flex;gap:6px;justify-content:center;padding:6px;"><button data-ubp-act="sheriff-run" class="ubp-btn primary" style="padding:6px 18px;">🙋 上警</button><button data-ubp-act="sheriff-notrun" class="ubp-btn" style="padding:6px 18px;">不上警</button></div>');
      return;
    }
    setControlArea('');
    revealSheriffSignup();
    const cands = game.sheriffCandidates || [];
    if (!cands.length) {
      addJudgeLog('🚨 无人上警，本局没有警长。', true);
      game.sheriffStage = 'done';
      game.sheriffDone = true;
      saveGameRecord();
      renderGameUI();
      afterSheriffElection(false);
      return;
    }
    if (cands.length === 1) {
      const only = game.players.find(p => p.position === cands[0]);
      game.sheriffPos = only.position;
      game.sheriffStage = 'done';
      game.sheriffDone = true;
      addJudgeLog('🚨 只有 ' + only.name + '（' + only.position + '号位）上警，TA自动当选警长！🎖️', true);
      saveGameRecord();
      renderGameUI();
      afterSheriffElection(true);
      return;
    }
    // 竞选发言顺序：先随机抽一位先发言，其余上警玩家按号位顺序依次等待发言
    const shuffled = cands.slice();
    const first = shuffled.splice(Math.floor(Math.random() * shuffled.length), 1)[0];
    const totalPos = game.players.length;
    const rest = shuffled.sort((a, b) => {
      const da = ((a - first) % totalPos + totalPos) % totalPos;
      const db = ((b - first) % totalPos + totalPos) % totalPos;
      return da - db;
    });
    game.sheriffSpeechQueue = [first].concat(rest);
    game.sheriffSpeechIdx = 0;
    game.sheriffStage = 'speech';
    addJudgeLog('🚨 上警玩家：' + cands.map(pos => pos + '号位').join('、') + '。竞选发言从 ' + first + '号位开始（随机抽取），其余按【顺时针（号位递增）】顺序等待发言。', true);
    saveGameRecord();
    renderGameUI();
    runNextSheriffSpeaker();
  }
  function generateSheriffSpeech(player, callback, rivals, attemptNo) {
